msgstr "继续解压"

msgid "Finish"
msgstr "完成"

msgid "Or drag an archive onto this window. Supported formats: ZIP, 7z, tar, tar.gz, tar.xz, and split archives."
msgstr "也可以将压缩包拖到此窗口。支持的格式：ZIP、7z、tar、tar.gz、tar.xz 和分卷压缩包。"

msgid "Or drag an archive onto this window. Supported formats: ZIP, 7z, tar, tar.gz, tar.xz, RAR, and split archives."
msgstr "也可以将压缩包拖到此窗口。支持的格式：ZIP、7z、tar、tar.gz、tar.xz、RAR 和分卷压缩包。"

